  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-oembed se-l-default\" id=\"SE-48c2182d-9e4c-415d-aaed-b14892e905d1\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-oembed se-section-align- se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-oembed se-is-progress\" style=\"padding-top: 177.77777777777777%;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module='{\"type\":\"v2_oembed\", \"id\" :\"SE-48c2182d-9e4c-415d-aaed-b14892e905d1\", \"data\" : { \"html\": &quot;&lt;iframe width&#x3D;\\&quot;400\\&quot; height&#x3D;\\&quot;225\\&quot; src&#x3D;\\&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Pgn6gUsRWBc?feature&#x3D;oembed\\&quot; frameborder&#x3D;\\&quot;0\\&quot; allow&#x3D;\\&quot;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\&quot; allowfullscreen title&#x3D;\\&quot;제발 그냥 좀 하세요\\&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&quot;, \"originalWidth\" : \"225\", \"originalHeight\" : \"400\", \"contentMode\" : \"fit\", \"description\": &quot;#돈버는법 #부업&quot;, \"inputUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/shorts/Pgn6gUsRWBc?feature&#x3D;share\", \"thumbnailUrl\" : \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Pgn6gUsRWBc/hq2.jpg\", \"thumbnailHeight\" : \"360\", \"thumbnailWidth\" : \"480\", \"title\": &quot;제발 그냥 좀 하세요&quot;, \"providerUrl\": \"https://www.youtube.com/\", \"align\": \"\", \"type\" : \"video\" }}'></script>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-a9bf1b8d-d6f7-4e99-8707-8cb46b4b6bb9\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0059a319-c14e-46f3-bc6b-8d62b45fd2c6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-54f5b3db-bcbe-4da2-a9ec-628cb3081505\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ce49e5db-4d13-464b-a510-af8d8f9856cb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-388a65f3-3e43-45f8-9cb7-5d49391c3ef3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0be068ea-756b-4b3f-add9-3ef4eb9177f6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-94855a5a-bc4a-4ba4-904a-c3f50bde8edf\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a5ecad17-7294-4488-b99f-897167fb4e05\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1c1d6ac1-c037-4421-8bf5-899e7cb846ee\">진짜 닥치고 하는 중이예요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7d7b9840-be48-45ea-adb6-c85c1bcb8f29\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0cb8304c-e853-45cc-b332-cbce4482e4e6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5fb25ef8-e742-42a7-8b08-f3303731bb28\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0b56f03a-169f-48ba-ad80-1835e6aab517\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-34dbb3c3-1f21-4b35-8cc8-f342216114d1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bb8c5916-72a9-412b-8d72-e5710d9abb6e\">뭘 하냐구요? </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1255ab32-9eda-40f0-ba2a-ecf79a344b3c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3db00fa2-7ff7-4176-874e-9e06215a3cfb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0c69a68a-0066-4306-b417-cec3188b4a32\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c501d14a-a907-458d-8b2b-fe9d86d4157b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-74b3dd26-1cc2-40ad-8231-5f1bf42fb4cc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3cb17576-71c8-44c9-9eac-fcdbb62de6ad\">1. 저 이번에 큰 유튜브 마케팅 계약을 했어요. 그래서 아주 닥치고 쇼츠 만드는 중이예요. 9-6에는 마케팅 회사 업무가 너무 많아서 그 일만 해요. 그 김에 주는사란 쇼츠도 맨날 만들고 있는데, 토나와요.ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-18928351-8e3e-46e6-9448-9354510e9d6a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f7fd8644-21cb-4b05-86d7-fe5c267b6faa\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-66366d47-cb76-4809-bd0f-d14cdb8c6cbe\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-43c3747f-83a3-4836-9f33-9ae82b96dbb9\">그래서 요즘 쇼츠 전문가 (?) 되고 있어요. 그건 이번주 토요일 실습특강때 진짜 다 알려드릴게요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d438b8c9-5b75-499e-9bf9-a2fc19a247f0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1d945f1f-b036-4f6e-b27d-61f4626e3652\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f2e6f2e2-ab4d-4ad5-937c-5a599bfc52a4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acd21271-4364-4e74-9e2e-a51458739b7a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a737085b-3ea2-479a-aa47-dd6562374e30\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-60b165dc-4e9f-4ab2-8779-6906513d0e89\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7d1be1cc-5b8a-4a5a-9e42-b0d120c06e2e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b8b9d5c0-2871-456b-a06e-c64d720b972d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3cfa0e97-0c5b-4f5e-ad9b-8fba1ae00c79\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d172f428-f045-404a-891b-151e99b2c0ab\">2. 0원에서 300만원 30일 챌린지 하는거 아시죠? 이것도 틈틈히 마케팅 하느라 아주 정신이 없어요. 지금 성과가 나오고 있습니다. 그 성과는 곧 유튜브에 업로드 하겠습니다. 요즘 본편까지 찍을시간이 안되서 허덕이고 있어요. 좀만 기다려 주세요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a7053939-75b3-4a03-b008-786043f7093b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0af94e92-e54d-40fa-82a1-ec9e4a80e20e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0ecf5f9f-23a7-49a9-bdba-8f47fde6c54f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-96cff5df-45a7-4bd4-9f0b-3169b615069d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-38d4c5ee-22bb-413c-aeb2-eaa5b46ec114\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-07fded93-6ec6-45f4-a0af-98a07ca1c0b3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a0f1a636-6e6b-4668-b3b6-00ed8813346f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-26419014-705f-4c0c-92ff-bd8c997889b6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eb3229bb-6274-4559-a420-392a53dc5b1c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-96058981-0b49-4984-be8e-fcb09916d2e1\">3. 0원에서 30일 챌린지 문의 성과중에 가장 큰 기여를 한게 네이버 플레이스예요. 출근 전에는 플레이스 강의 찍고 있는데요. 아침에 일찍 일어나야 되서 죽을것 같지만 재밌어요 ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ 진짜 플레이스 로직이 너무 다양해요. 참고로 강의 안들으시더라도 무료 강의 3강 오픈했으니 들어보세요. 3강만 들으셔도 도움 되실수 있도록 찍었거든요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f373552d-ae9e-4b28-832c-3ef8bb685876\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b9220272-74ac-457d-838f-c3b07c2f7ac8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dcfdb010-6c09-4289-be05-c81066c5111e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-752fd3fe-d2a7-4e76-8327-9bf145eecb2d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5386e47e-692c-4318-9db7-2636c071fbdd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a6172c22-7356-4b22-a3f3-d4d9d527f2e9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d75c6598-8f70-4d3c-8df9-5c2ac4621e07\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b35840d5-cf06-453f-8d77-d52ab2bd16ed\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a3d08d95-ec72-4310-b0ac-d295dd656443\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-475fa954-9ca6-45a3-99aa-17d7d83cdd78\">4. 제가 원래 하고 싶었던 다른 유튜브도 있어서, 그것도 퇴근하고 찍고 있어요. 그것도 좀더 성과가 나오면 공유드릴게요!</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-21f25ac0-d262-4b16-9695-d3c1fed8a40c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-dea5fa99-8f1c-42d2-870e-8cb20d58aef2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9b109b1b-4685-4944-a138-ce523f7af105\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bf6f88d1-6b66-4b2a-a717-c96244c70053\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8b806b7b-5cad-4be0-9384-ba3ca05c5469\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-04d19048-f134-435a-9652-e5a142ecb271\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bff3989b-9220-4c47-bfc2-a32575f8f0b7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-328485d5-a5c9-43b1-9f5b-e5e05475eb74\">그니까 결론은 토나오는 생활중이예요. 카페 댓글도 계속 달아야지...하는데 너무 정신없고 졸려서 못 달고 있어요ㅠㅠ 틈틈히 달겠습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2b566c3a-927c-4480-9034-087023716bb1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a2a2ee7e-8798-4f5e-80e2-26a5f5491bac\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d3e9e733-5a39-4973-89d1-6adc7d8b822b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c7c92a7a-ea08-46d8-96ca-e47eb50ccfdc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c6d4fc22-9957-4ac1-ab53-5c1e47a44eb3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fe49189f-9d61-4720-879b-a75b5f7bd3de\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-593bf4b7-6159-4c38-a930-bbd47cf2eef1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d9b651d1-77b8-4535-9ae0-b77f0dc2be75\">다시한번 직장인들 너무 존경합니다............</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-472703fe-f3b8-49ac-8e27-0d1473e5e512\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7866e9e2-c97f-46b7-9fb6-2e6adf2e5acc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7c3afe1c-edb7-41cc-adcd-bbedc32685e3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e4d46c80-9501-4160-92ce-ae3b007d5896\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
